## Step 3: Deploy on Railway

1. Go to [railway.app](https://railway.app) → **New Project → GitHub Repository**
2. Select your `vibecheck-v2` repo
3. Go to **Variables** tab → Add these:

| Name | Value |
|------|-------|
| `DISCORD_TOKEN` | *(new bot token from Step 1)* |
| `CLIENT_ID` | *(new Client ID from Step 1)* |
| `OPENAI_API_KEY` | *(same as old bot)* |
| `SUPABASE_URL` | *(same as old bot)* |
| `SUPABASE_KEY` | *(same as old bot)* |
| `RESEND_API_KEY` | *(same as old bot)* |

4. Click **Deploy**

---

## Step 4: Invite the New Bot to Your Test Server

Once deployed, use this invite link (replace `YOUR_NEW_CLIENT_ID`):
```
https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=YOUR_NEW_CLIENT_ID&permissions=2147552256&integration_type=0&scope=bot+applications.commands
